window.products.push({"id":140056,"name":"Ice Maker Machine for Countertop with Automatic Self-Cleaning, 9 Bullet Ice Cube Ready in 7-9 Minutes, 26Lbs/24H Portable Ice Makers with LCD, S/M/L I","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wHt7SAnuL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍺【Portable Size& Durable Material】The small ice maker measures only 14.4 x 9.8x 12.9 inches, can fit on most countertop, and easy to store when not in use. This portable ice maker is made of high quality stainless steel, achieving the perfect combination of a long-lasting shiny finish and superior durability. 🍨【3 Types of Ice Cubes(SML)】Bullet-shaped clear ice cube comes in 3 selectable size(SML), perfect for chilling drinks, storing food or for first aid .This compact ice maker have wide applications, whenever and wherever you are, ice is there.You can perfectly use it for kitchens, offices, parties, basement bars, tea shop and more. 🥂【Efficient& Quiet Ice Making 】 9 Bullet Ice Cubes Ready in 7-9 Minutes , produce up 26 pounds of ice in 24 hours, which enables you to have fresh and good ice every day. Since this ice maker needs time to preheat,the first or second time will be slightly less effective and will be normal after a few more uses. Countertop ice maker runs at less than 35dB, this not only helps you save energy, but also keeps bullet ice maker cool and ensures a quiet environment. 🍹【One-Touch & LCD Digital Display】The automatic ice cube maker reacts quickly to every time you click the button in the operation area. With simple control panel, just add water, select the ice size, it is ready to work. Ice maker indicators will remind you to take out the ice cubes when the basket is full and inform you to add the water when the ice maker lacks of water. Top cover with transparent window design, you can see directly through it. 💌【Refund Guarantee】We are confident that you will have a great experience with Techdorm ice makers. If ice machines countertop fail to live up to your expectations, simply return them for a full refund. Customer Satisfaction is our TOP priority. if you have any problem, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wHt7SAnuL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Techdorm","source_asin":"B09TQLQ71H","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-140056","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TQLQ71H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TQLQ71H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
