window.products.push({"id":140152,"name":"Romalon 134792700 Dryer Heating Element Compatible with Electrolux Frigidaire Dryers, with Replacement Parts 137032600 & 3204267 Dryer High Limit Ther","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EEaGaGCmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Romalon Heating Element 134792700 137032600&3204267 Safety Thermostat Producing no heat might not cause for being replaced a new dryer. Sometimes what all you need is a dryer repair kit replacement parts. Package Include: 1 PC 134792700 Heating Element 1 PC 3204267 Safety Thermostat 1 PC 137032600 High Limit Thermal Fuse UPGRADED - QUALITY: Adopted quality nickle in the wire and well-tested by the manufacturer. The length of the heating wire is 25% longer than other common dryer replacement parts. 134792700 heater which is rated at 5500 Watts 240 Volts has 3 separate heating coils.Non original aftermarket part. Fits OEM Standards! Exceed OEM Requirements! Save Time and Save Money: Save you a bunch of cash! 3204267 Thermostat will cut off the power to the heating element If the dryer overheats The thermostat replaces : AP2131477, 508516, AH446428, EA446428, PS446428, 145160, 73204267. 137032600 Thermal Fuse replaces : 137060800, 1483164, AH2349395, AP4368739, EA2349395, and PS2349395. Fix the following issues: No heat or not enough heat Takes too long to dry Too hot Will not shut off Installation Tips: Disconnect your dryer from its power source before starting the repair. You’ll need a quarter-inch socket or wrench and a flathead screwdriver for this repair. Before disconnecting any wires, take a picture so that you know how to reconnect everything at the end. If necessary, follow some Youtube vedioes to avoid short circuit. Replacement takes under 30-minutes to complete. NOTE: The mention of brand names and any related model designation above is only for purposes of demonstrating compatibility.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EEaGaGCmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Romalon","source_asin":"B088LQZQ8F","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-140152","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088LQZQ8F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B088LQZQ8F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
