window.products.push({"id":140159,"name":"2023 Upgraded Dryer Repair Kit for Samsung Dryer Roller DC97-16782A/DC97-16782E, Dryer Belt 6602-001655, Idler Pulley DC93-00634A - Replaces dv48h7400","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oym3WX+GL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔✔【DC97-16782A DRYER REPAIR KIT】: Upgraded DC97-16782A Samsung Dryer Repair Kit adopts high-quality rubber overall structure and silent double ball bearing design.▶The 5ph2337 6602-001655 dryer belt for samsung is upgraded( thickness increased to 1.5 times) ,the length is standard(92’’Length X 0.3’’Width).▶Upgrade the bearing, the center of the idler has a triangular design,which is more firm and stable.▶The most unique upgrade is that the shaft of roller is a square design for easier handling. ✔✔【PACKAGE INCLUDES】: DC97-16782A Dryer Repair Kit includes 4 x upgraded DC97-16782A dryer drum rollers, 1 x DC93-00634A upgraded idler pulley (with 1pc screw), 1 x 6602-001655 upgraded dryer belt, 1 x DC61-01215B Tension Spring. ▶Notice: Please use high temperature lubricant when installing to reduce noise. Disconnect the power before installing DC97-16782a dryer repair kit for samsung, and wear work gloves to protect your hands. ✔✔【COMPATIBLE MODEL】: ▶DC97-16782A Dryer roller replacement kit is sturdy and wear-resistant, silent without cracking, keeping your dryer in top condition.❶DC97-16782A replaces DC97-07523A, DC97-07523B, 2027851, EAP4221885 ❷DC93-00634A Dryer Idler Pulley replaces DC96-00882B, DC96-00882C, DC97-07509B, 4455850, EAP11771601 ❸6602-001655 Belt replaces 5PH2337, 6602-001314, 1935594, EAP2407938 ❹DC61-01215B Idler spring replaces 2069087, AP4211487, PS4206154, EAP4206154. ✔✔【2 YEARS WARRANTY】: During the 2 years warranty period, If the Samsung Dryer Roller Replacement Kit has quality problem or other reasons, we support return, replacement or refund, Customer satisfaction is our unremitting pursuit. Risk free shopping, If you have any quality questions during the warranty, please contact us in time, we are here to help. ✔✔【EFFECTIVE FIX & INSTALLATION】: Upgraded dc97-16782a samsung dryer repair kit can help your dryer fix the following problems: dryer is squeaky or noisy, won’t tumble or spin, will not start, leaves marks on clothes, no heat or not enough heat, etc. ▶Installation is simple, the tools required are phillips head screwdrivers, socket set, and a pair of vice grips or a 3/8\" or 5/16\" open end wrench. You can find the repair video on YouTube and follow it to install samsung dryer roller replacement.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oym3WX+GL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Techecook","source_asin":"B08R72J3YN","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-140159","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08R72J3YN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08R72J3YN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
