window.products.push({"id":140270,"name":"Egg Holder for Refrigerator, FODIENS Auto Scrolling Down Egg Storage Container Egg Tray with Timetable Lid and Handle, Stackable Egg Storage Box Organ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7182EYw9fbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Stackable & Large Capacity】Can be stored vertically and stacked in multiple layers, and the silicone non-slip feet are conducive to stable placement. Each tier can hold 21 eggs, the lid can be easily opened for filling eggs, and the compact and stackable design helps maximize space savings and keeps your kitchen counter, refrigerator or cupboard neat and organized. 【Exquisite Workmanship】Our exquisite Egg Storage Boxes are made of premium food-grade plastic materials, with smooth edges that not easy to hurt hands, and can be placed in the refrigerator without fear of low temperature. There are ventilation holes on the sides to keep the eggs always fresh and prolong the storage period of the eggs. 【Auto Scrolling & Visible Design】With a large opening and sloping design, when you take out the eggs, the remaining eggs will automatically roll to the front empty space for the next use. The transparent clamshell design makes the number of eggs clear at a glance, which is convenient for timely replenishment. 【Silicone Track & Timetable】Non-slip silicone pads are embedded in the inner groove, so that the eggs will not run around and will not break when they collide. The timetable (31 days) on the lid is used to remind you of the freshness of your eggs at all times. 【Convenient Egg Separator and Whisk】In addition to our 21 grid Egg Holder, you will also get a press type egg beater and an egg white and yolk separator, easy to operate, time-saving and labor-saving, easy to clean, specially provided for you who are busy in the kitchen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7182EYw9fbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FODIENS","source_asin":"B09N3HG4PZ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-140270","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09N3HG4PZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09N3HG4PZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
