window.products.push({"id":140349,"name":"Danby Silhouette 36\" Stainless Steel Under-Cabinet Range Hood","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FWfwMsnsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product description With Danby's DURH361SSSL Silhouette 36 In. Under-the-Cabinet Range Hood, in stainless steel, you get quiet yet powerful ventilation without losing precious cupboard space. The dual centrifugal fans efficiently remove cooking vapors and smoke with three powerful speeds up to 450 CFM. Dual halogen lights (high/low) provide exceptional task lighting while you are cooking. Readily accessible front-mount controls with LED display and back-lit buttons allow for easy operation of special features including heat sensor, auto-off and “clean filter” reminder. Danby's DURH361SSSL requires a top-mount 6-inch round duct. Package Content: range hoodmanualwarranty Heat Sensor automatically turns on highest fan setting when cooking surface temperature reaches 158F Auto-off function allows fan to continue running for 5 minutes to clear residual vapors and then shut off Automatic clean filter reminder Dishwasher safe aluminum mesh filters Color Stainless Steel Height 12.19 Width 35.38 Depth 20.69 Weight 35.00 Operating System Batteries Included Batteries Required Number of Batteries 0 Battery Type Does Not Contain a Battery Language English, Spanish, French Assembly Required From the Manufacturer Danby�s 36\" Silhouette under-cabinet range hood is sure to spruce up any kitchen with its stylish stainless steel finish. This range hood has dual centrifugal fans, a heat sensor and an auto-off function. It also has dual halogen lights and an easily accessible front mount control panel with LED display and back-lit buttons for easy operation. Boasting 3 powerful fan speeds, this unit exhausts up to 450 cfm. It also includes an auto clean filter reminder and a dishwasher safe aluminum mesh filter and is backed by an industry leading 2 year parts and labor warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FWfwMsnsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Danby","source_asin":"B00891PKCA","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-140349","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00891PKCA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B00891PKCA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
