window.products.push({"id":140453,"name":"Sunny Town Stove Burner Covers- Reusable Gas Range Protectors,Non-stick Stovetop Burner Liner Cover-Size 10.6\"x 10.6\"-Double Thickness 0.2mm,BPA Free,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715b2FBfQrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A Simple Tool to Keep Your Stovetop Clean, Free of Greasy Kitchen! SUNNY TOWN stove burner cover is in smooth surface and high temperature resistance, made of premium glass fiber composited PTFE, it will maintain physical form  and won't deformed under the -94°F~+500°F(-70℃~+260℃) because of its high abrasion resistance,low coefficient of friction. Features: -Reusable stove burner covers last long and save your money. -Non-stick gas range protectors keep your stovetop clean. -Cuttable design allows you to adjust easily to your gas burner. -Safe to be cleaned by dishwasher, certified material, no worries. -Easy to remove when you need to clean them. Specification: -Material: Certified material of PTFE, 100% PFOA&BPA free. -Size: 10.6”x 10.6”(27cm x 27cm),with pre-cut inner radius in 1.8 inch, you can trim it easily to fit your stovetop. -0.2mm Double thickness for lasting durability and it is reusable. -Color: Black -Pack:Set of 8 pieces How to use: First Step - Measuring the size precisely and mark by pen. Second Step - Cutting to the suitable size according to the mark. Third Step - Taking off the stove accessories and laying the cover. Last Step - Reassembling accessories and finish. Warning: -DO NOT use directly on flame or heat element.The material is not 100% fireproof. Please make sure that the gas stove burner covers is kept at least 0.5 inches from the flame  to avoid any damages of the product or other injuries. -DO NOT cover gas/vent holes of the stove -DO NOT use above 500 ℉ -Remove protector first before cleaning the stove Sunnytown Gas Range Protectors , an effective and wholehearted server for your stove ,you don't have to worry about your stove getting dirty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715b2FBfQrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sunny Town","source_asin":"B07CDCVFXV","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-140453","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CDCVFXV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CDCVFXV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
