window.products.push({"id":140471,"name":"Refill Cup - Reusable Refillable K Cup Filter - Compatible with Keurig 1.0 and 2.0 (4 Pack)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61azGtb-qvL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Keurig Reusable KCup Filter Make single-serving coffee systems greener with ReFill Cup Reusable Coffee K-Cups for Keurig 2.0 and 1.0 Brewers. While single-cup machines are incredibly convenient, they can be costly and generate far more waste than traditional electric coffee-making systems. K-Cups and similar products can only be used once before they're thrown away, winding up in landfills or the ocean where they can harm wildlife and take decades to biodegrade. With the ReFill Cup filter, you can still enjoy single-cup convenience without incurring the high costs of disposable cups or generating excessive waste, making it easy to use your preferred blend. They are also designed specifically to hold liquids of a high temperature, so are completely safe. Make and take your favorite ground coffee. Very easy to use and reliable for the long term. Ultra smart in size and style. You simply remove the filter from your brew system, wash it out and store it away for next time. The filter is the same size as disposable K-Cups. Reusable coffee cups can be used over and over, reducing waste and helping keep the environment cleaner and healthier.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61azGtb-qvL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Refill Cup","source_asin":"B07KYVLTKX","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-140471","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KYVLTKX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KYVLTKX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":140472,"name":"Honeywell PUR HEV685W Top Fill Console Humidifier, Large, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":129.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-lBVn3ueL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"The Honeywell Easy-to-Care Cool Moisture Console Humidifier (HEV685W) provides soothing, invisible cool moisture and a calming environment. During cold and flu season, when kick in, or the air is simply just dry, you can rely on this humidifier for your whole family. Honeywell humidifiers for bedroom and beyond add necessary moisture to the air, and help ensure proper humidity levels in your home. Indoor humidity levels between 40-60% can help relieve cough and congestion, keep throat and nasal passages hydrated, temporarily relieve dry air discomfort, protect furniture, reduce static electricity and even keep plants healthier. This Honeywell humidifier is ideal for large rooms, and is quick and easy to use and clean. Designed for high moisture output, this large humidifier features two 1.5-gallon tanks and can run up to 24 hours on the low setting. The two removable top-fill water tanks each have a large opening and can be filled easily at the sink or with a pitcher. The translucent tanks allow for viewing water level and the flat bottom and feet allow the tank to stand independently. This advanced humidifier has an adjustable humidistat with high, medium, and low speed settings, and it automatically turns on and off to maintain your desired humidity level. The humidifier also shuts off automatically when the tanks are empty and has a refill light that signals when the tanks need to be filled. This Honeywell cool moisture humidifier includes a wicking filter that removes minerals from water, reducing white in hard water areas and providing clean moisture output. The humidifier filter is treated with Protec which helps Keeps off the growth and migration of external particles and on the filter.*. To ensure optimal product performance, use only genuine Honeywell Replacement Wicking Filter Model HC-14 (Filter E), which helps Keeps off the growth and migration of external particles on the filter.* *Based on internal laboratory test report #SM211AF","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-lBVn3ueL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Honeywell","source_asin":"B07FXYHZCF","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-140472","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FXYHZCF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FXYHZCF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
