window.products.push({"id":140749,"name":"(Upgrade 2023) 12001541 303373 303373k Dryer Drum Roller Kit & WP6-3700340 Idler Pulley & WP33002535 Drum Belt by Beaquicy - Replacement for Ken-more ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fAkdTtNqL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"【𝟏𝟐𝟎𝟎𝟏𝟓𝟒𝟏 𝑫𝑹𝒀𝑬𝑹 𝑫𝑹𝑼𝑴 𝑹𝑶𝑳𝑳𝑬𝑹 𝑲𝑰𝑻】: The kit is between the dryer drum and the housing. ➤The 12001541 Dryer Drum Support Roller holds the drum in place while the drum rotates on the support wheels. ➤The WP33002535 Drum Belt attaches to the motor pulley and is used to rotate the drum. The belt is 91.5 inches long and 5/16 inches wide. Flat on one side with 5 ridges on the other side. ➤The WP6-3700340 Dryer Idler Pulley maintains tension on the drive belt to spin the drum. 【𝑨𝑩𝑺 𝑷𝑳𝑨𝑺𝑻𝑰𝑪 𝑨𝑵𝑫 𝑹𝑼𝑩𝑩𝑬𝑹】: The 12001541 Dryer Drum Repair Kit includes 2 x 12001541 Dryer Drum Support Roller(with washers and nuts), 1 x WP6-3700340 Dryer Idler Pulley, 1 x WP33002535 Dryer Drum Belt. ➤The kit is made of high quality ABS plastic and rubber material for excellent durability and firmness. High-quality rollers make the dryer run more smoothly. The high quality rubber material allows the belt to remain taut in position and is less likely to be worn and cracked. 【𝟑𝟔𝟓 𝑫𝑨𝒀𝑺 𝑾𝑨𝑹𝑹𝑨𝑵𝑻𝒀】: Dryer 12001541 Drum Roller Kit WP6-3700340 Idler Pulley WP33002535 Drum Belt supports 365 days return and exchange. ➤The roller kit has been upgraded in the quality and workmanship of the materials, increasing thickness of plastic and rubber layer on wheels, which greatly extends the service life of the product. ➤If kit is broken, the dryer will have the FOLLOWING CONDITIONS, please replaced in time: Dryer is noisy. Parts wear. Belt slipping. Not rolling. 【𝑾𝑰𝑫𝑬 𝑪𝑶𝑴𝑷𝑨𝑻𝑰𝑩𝑰𝑳𝑬】: 12001541 Dryer Drum Repair Kit can fit for Cros-ley, May-tag Dryer.➤12001541 Drum Roller Kit Replace: 12001541VP, W10116741, 3-3373, 303373, 303373K, Y303373, DE693, K35-248, 400518, AP4008534, PS1570070, EAP1570070, etc. ➤WP6-3700340 Idler Pulley Replace: AP6009859, 33001783, 6-3700340, WP6-3700340VP, 1472812, AP4373393, PS2347262, EAP2347262, etc. ➤WP33002535 Drum Belt Replace: 33001777, 33002535, WP33002535VP, 791135, AP6007983, PS11741110, EAP11741110, etc. 【𝑭𝑰𝑻 𝑴𝑨𝑵𝒀 𝑴𝑶𝑫𝑬𝑳𝑺】: The 12001541 Dryer Drum Support Roller Kit fit the following models: CDE4205AYW, MDE6657BYQ, NDE6800AYW, CDE4205AZJ, MDE16CSAYQ, MDE16PRAZW, MDE8416AYA, MDE8426AGW, MDE8506AYW, MDE8600AYW, MDE8600AZW, MDE8757AYQ, LG23PDHGW, MDE16PDAUW, MDE2500AZW, MDE3000AYW, MDE3600AYW, MDE4000AYW, MDG8416AWA, MDG8426AAW, MDG8506AWA, MDG8600AWW, MDG9206AWA, MDG9206AXW, MDG9357AWA, MDG9390BWW, MDG9557AXW, MDG9606AWQ, MDG9606BWW, MHW2000AWW, MLG2000AWW, MLG23PDHXW, MDG6800AWQ, etc. 【𝑩𝑹𝑰𝑵𝑮 𝑪𝑶𝑵𝑽𝑬𝑵𝑰𝑬𝑵𝑪𝑬 𝑭𝑶𝑹 𝒀𝑶𝑼𝑹 𝑳𝑰𝑭𝑬】: The installation of 12001541 Dryer Drum Kit is simple. Before replacing, turn off the power supply and wear work gloves. Remove the back cover of the dryer and locate where the kit is located. Secure the roller under the roller with nuts and bolts. Put on the belt and keep it taut. Make sure the rollers and belts are securely installed and will not fall off. You can save a lot of money on replacing the dryer or hiring a mechanic.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fAkdTtNqL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B088NC82NX","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-140749","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088NC82NX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B088NC82NX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
