window.products.push({"id":140784,"name":"Waterdrop Plus ADQ73613401 NSF 401&53&42 Certified Refrigerator Water Filter and Air Filter, 𝐑𝐞𝐝𝐮𝐜𝐞 𝐏𝐅𝐀𝐒, Replacement for LG® LT800P®, ADQ73613402, Ke","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ES2Jy7wvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Waterdrop brand is tried and trusted by more than 6 million US families to provide them with purer, cleaner, safer drinking water. We provide only high quality replacement filters that are certified as reducing a wide range of impurities by NSF 401, 53, 42 and 372. This Waterdrop WDP-F20 replacement water filter for LG refrigerator is comprehensively certified by NSF against NSF/ANSI 401, 53, 42 &372 Standards test from each component to the filter cartridge as a whole to achieve a supreme filtration performance. This filter has been strictly certified by NSF 401 to reduce phenytoin, naproxen, estrone and bisphenol A. Asides it has also been tested according to NSF/ANSI 53 standards to reduce lead, benzene, mercury, PFOA&PFOS in water. [Deep filtration] Waterdrop's refrigerator filters significantly reduce the levels of many different harmful substances in your water, including a 95.3% reduction in PFOA and PFOS tested by the third-party laboratory. Moreover, the filter additionally allows through many of the beneficial minerals in water that are essential for health. [Fast water flow, no leaks] Our mission is to supply refrigerator water filters that fit perfectly, impeccably engineered; this sets us apart from inferior models of replacement filters that can frequently result in water leakage problems. The microscopic pore sizes in our filter cartridges, made of superior materials, allow for smooth running, crisp, pure water. [Carefully chosen materials] Waterdrop uses coconut shell carbon blocks supplied from Sri Lanka that have enlarged surface area and more micropores than inferior carbon blocks. The filter cartridge is far more effective in reducing levels of chlorine, dirt, sediment, rust, and a wide range of heavy metals tested by a third-party laboratory. Based on our high attention to detail, we selected a BPA-free, food-grade housing for the filter that exceeds NSF 372 lead-free filtration certification. [Regular filter changes] If you run replacement filter past the recommended date, something could accumulate and filtration performance could suffer. Because of this, we supply a complimentary set of installation stickers with every filter so that you can see at a glance when it needs replacing. We recommend that you should replace your filter after it has been used for 200 gallons or 6 months (this may vary dependent on the water condition in your area). [Professional standards] Our expert teams pride themselves on not letting any product or part of a product, down to the smallest components, leave our factory unless we are satisfied that they have reached and exceeded the very highest market standards. Our dedication doesn't just apply within the factory: we have a customer service team ready to answer your questions and deal with any problems 24/7. [More than just a business] Waterdrop is passionate about providing clean water for as many people as possible with lower environmental impact. We use cowhide corrugated box packaging, reducing the wastage other companies create with their materials. A percentage of the purchase price from every one of our filters is used to fund projects providing clean, pure water for African children who don't have access to safe water supplies. [Replacement for filter models] LG LT800P, ADQ73613401, ADQ73613408, ADQ75795104, Kenmore 9490, 46-9490, 469490, ADQ73613402. LG is a registered trademark of LG CORP. LG is used for reference purposes only. [Compatible with] LMXC23746D, LMXC23746S, LMXS30746S, LMXS30756S, LMXS30776D, LMXS30776S, LMXS30786S, LNXC23726S, LNXC23766D, LNXS30866D, LPXS30866D, LPXS30866S, LPXS30876D, LSC22991ST, LSXC22326S, LSXC22336S, LSXC22386D, LSXC22386S, LSXS22423B, LSXS22423S, LSXS22423W, LSXS26326B, LSXS26326S, LSXS26326W, LSXS26336V , LSXS26366D, LSXS26366S, LSXS26386D, LSXS26386S, LSXS26466D, LSXS26466S, LUPXC2386N, LUPXS3186N, LMXS30776, LMXC24746S, LSXS27466","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ES2Jy7wvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WATERDROP","source_asin":"B07Y589ZHY","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-140784","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Y589ZHY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Y589ZHY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
