window.products.push({"id":140901,"name":"LifePlus Ice Maker Commercial - 70lbs/24H Ice Machine 32 Ice Cubes in 11-20 Minutes, Freestanding Cabinet Ice Maker with 13 Lbs Storage Bin, 2 Ways Ad","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":259.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CJoIbdgML._SL1001_.jpg","description":"【Two Ways Add Water and 3 Thicknesses Ice】- We designed many functions for the LIFEPLUS ice cube maker – 1. You can use drinking water or bucket water for the machine water supply, and adjust the cube size(S-M-L) on the fly. 2. When the water runs out, this humanized partner will remind you. 3. One-button auto cleaning ensure that the ice cubes are clean and free of odor. Enjoy the clear, fresh and healthy nugget ice every day! 【Quickly Ice Making】- Just plug in power, add water and enjoy a batch of ice 32 cubes in about 11-20 minutes. This ice machine can make up to 70 lbs plenty of ice cubes in 24 hours, equipped with high-power compressor and 10 lbs of ice bin for ice storing, meet the needs of 5-8 members in your family, and you never have to run to the store for a bag of ice again. 【Multiple Uses】- This is both a household ice maker and a commercial ice machine. This undercounter ice maker can appear anywhere. You can use it in your Home/Indoor Kitchen, or in Restaurant Bar Hotel Coffee shops Supermarkets Bakeries Cold drink shops Schools Party events and so on. Can't wait to make more shaved ice cocktails in the coming weeks of celebration! 【Easy to Use and Operate】- With a simple control panel, the indicator panel symbol lights up when the bin is full or service is needed. How to install the ice maker machine? It’s really a piece of cake, you just need to connect 2 water tubes or put the water bucket on the ice maker, choose the valve horizontal or vertical, plug in the power cord and turn on the home ice maker. Very easy, isn’t it? 【Full Set Of Accessories】- Commercial ice maker comes with a full set of accessories, including an ice scoop, a 9-inch long water supply hose with faucet connector and a 6.5-inch long draining hose. Before first use, clean the freestanding ice maker and keep it in an upright position for 24 hours. After getting ice, the ice moved to the refrigerator. Don't hesitate, own it! It’s time to indulge in ice anytime, anywhere, like head out boating and family gathering.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CJoIbdgML._SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LifePlus","source_asin":"B09FLSR3D1","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-140901","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FLSR3D1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FLSR3D1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
